  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The shell pattern repeats over 6 stitches: 5 trebles into a single stitch, skip 2, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-anchor"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "anchor dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", skip 2. Shells in alternate rows sit in the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-anchor"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "anchor dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of the row below, building a staggered scallop pattern."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Five trebles per "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shell-cushion"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "shell"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at DK weight gives defined fans without pulling the fabric. Total yarn around 450 m for both panels."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "DK yarn",
              "qty": "450 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "4 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            },
            {
              "name": "40 cm cushion pad",
              "qty": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Panel (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 61 (multiple of 6, plus 1). Row 1 (foundation): dc across. Row 2 (shell row): ch 3, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shell-cushion"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "5 tr in 4th st"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", * skip 2, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-anchor"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", skip 2, 5 tr in next st; rep. Row 3 (shift row): ch 1, dc in first tr, * 5 tr in anchor dc below, dc in centre tr of shell; rep. Alternate rows 2 and 3 until 40 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whipstitch three sides. Insert pad. Close remaining side. Align shell ridges across front and back if using the same panel for both."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
